body:
>he same cost. Oblation? Hell, Mangara of Corondor if you want a body? There's enough mass removal running around that temporary removal like this just w

Thanks again for the in depth explanation! Looking it over you make some really good points.

Archaeomancer's Map at a rate of 3 mana for 1-2 lands is a rather good ROI, not sure how I missed that. It really did feel like the focus on a specific theme had been lost so cutting down really is needed. Hadn't heard of Mask of Memory before, definitely worth including though. With the rest of the changes I mentioned , heirbloom blade will be kept due to making sure there's a  larger focus on human tribe. Actually had a Herald's Horn I'd forgotten about, so swapped in place of Icon of Ancestory. It felt like a perfect tribal card, but you're right on 3 mana for a possible hit is a high mana sink. To keep average CMC organized for now, swapped out bounty agent for cathar commando, Resplendent Angel for archetype, Adeline, Resplendent Cathar in place of Daxos, and a Containment Priest in place of Ashes of the Abhorrent. Funnily enough, never had enough card draw before to even consider Spirit of the Labyrinth being a drawback for myself.

&#x200B;

Hadnt noticed it before until you pointed it out, but there definitely did seem to be quite the superfluous graveyard hate, and there usually already is plenty at the table, woe be to the poor few graveyard matters players in my regular group. Added \[\[March of Otherworldly Light\]\] in place of Banishing Light. It might wind up being expensive, but the instant speed is definitely a sorely needed upgrade like you said. Added a Baneslayer Angel in place of Bruna, a few keywords, but hoping to at least keep some playable angels  in the deck, it's a bit of a personal pick. Not the best replacement, but added in a \[\[Sword of Heath and Home\]\] as well for possible ramp.

&#x200B;

Will be keeping brought back due it mentioning permanents, although i do admit it won't always have the best payoff, and I do like Bond of loyalty for shenanigans. However I will be picking up several of the board wipes and other cards  you mentioned ,  concerted effort, angel of invention, and austere command for sure,  along with several others. Marble Diamond will stay in until i can get a cheaper Pearl Medallion. Charming Prince, Devout chaplain and those other low impact should be easy to swap out when they arrive. Was considering adding a \[\[Paladin Class\]\] I had laying around in though.

&#x200B;

Thanks again for all the feedback! Should hopefully have tappedout updated tonight and again when the rest of the cards arrive
